(x15-certified-landing-checkpoint-6dof)
*title X-15 terminal approach checkpoint without runway contact
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=7.2921151467e-5 gm=3.986004418e14
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=18.580608 reference-length=3.130296 inertia-x=4948.7355 inertia-y=129114.2666 inertia-z=131825.9024 dry-mass-kg=9000.0
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime status terminal-checkpoint=true contact-model=absent
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=1.0 lower=0.4 upper=1.0
*runtime control symmetric-stabilator-deg vehicle=1 default=0.0 lower=-14.9 upper=34.9
*trajectory 1 x15 start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6398137.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=1800.0 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5 qx=-0.5 qy=-0.5 qz=0.5 time=0.0 mass=14641.0545 propellant_mass=5641.0545
  *segment 1 terminal-approach-checkpoint
    *integ dtprnt=0.01 dt=0.001
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *prop thrust=(x15-thrust) mdot=(x15-mdot)
    *when time>0.01 stop
*end
